This project is a derivative work of **PsychonautWiki Journal**
(https://github.com/isaakhanimann/psychonautwiki-journal-android),
Copyright (C) 2022 Isaak Hanimann, licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later.

Modifications and additions by Wolren include:
- Ported from Android-only (Jetpack Compose) to Compose Multiplatform
  (desktop + Android + iOS)
- Replaced Couchbase Lite with JSON-file persistence
- Added P2P sync via Ktor (local network, no cloud relay)
- Complete UI rewrite in Compose Multiplatform
- New features: tolerance dashboard, activity heatmap, custom theme
  editor, custom substance editor, timeline visualization

The PsychonautWiki substance reference data (dosage, duration,
interaction data) is sourced from the public PsychonautWiki GraphQL
API and is used under fair use / public data principles.
